@startuml caching-flow
title Кэширование: cache-aside Search/Catalog + invalidate по Kafka

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Guest
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Search\nService" as Search
participant "Redis" as Redis
participant "OpenSearch" as OS
participant "Catalog\nService" as Catalog
participant "Kafka" as Kafka
database "db-catalog" as DB

== Cache-aside: поиск (hot query) ==

Guest -> GW : GraphQL search
GW -> Search : gRPC Query
Search -> Redis : GET search:{hash(params)}

alt cache HIT
  Redis --> Search : cached page
  Search --> GW : results (TTL ≤ 60s)
else cache MISS
  Redis --> Search : miss
  Search -> OS : query geo/filters
  OS --> Search : hits
  Search -> Redis : SETEX key 60 payload\n(+ stampede lock)
  Search --> GW : results
end

note over Search, Redis
  Инвалидация только по TTL:
  слишком много комбинаций фильтров
  для event-based сброса.
end note

== Cache-aside: карточка объекта + invalidate ==

Guest -> GW : GET property
GW -> Catalog : gRPC Get
Catalog -> Redis : GET catalog:prop:{id}

alt cache HIT
  Redis --> Catalog : card
else cache MISS
  Catalog -> DB : SELECT
  DB --> Catalog : row
  Catalog -> Redis : SETEX ... 600
end
Catalog --> GW : card

... partner обновляет объект ...

Catalog -> DB : UPDATE + outbox
Catalog -> Kafka : catalog.updated
Kafka -> Catalog : (или отдельный consumer)
Catalog -> Redis : DEL catalog:prop:{id}

note over Catalog, Redis
  Hold / available count **не** кэшируем
  как permission на hold:
  SoT = Inventory Postgres (ADR-0003).
end note

@enduml
